      "descriptionHtml": "<p>Laperva Keto Cola is a cola-flavoured soft drink designed for consumers looking for a zero-calorie beverage option. It combines a familiar cola flavour with selected functional ingredients, including branched-chain amino acids (BCAAs), and is sweetened with stevia.</p><p>Each product contains 100 mg of BCAAs, a group of three essential amino acids: leucine, isoleucine and valine. These amino acids are included as part of the beverage's formulation. The product is also marketed as a zero-calorie drink, making it an option for consumers seeking a calorie-free cola alternative.</p><p>Laperva Keto Cola is sweetened with stevia and offers a convenient beverage option. Its cola flavour makes it suitable for consumers looking for an alternative to conventional cola drinks.</p>",
